#: ../../source/get_started/play_with_dingo_using_dingoclient.md:182
#: 4278394cc0974804a80f1c5309403edf
msgid ""
"DingoDB presents a Java API which is comprehensive and powerful, but "
"requires a measure of boiler plate code to map the data from Java POJOs "
"to the database. The Annotation is aim to lower the amount of code "
"required when mapping POJOs to DingoDB and back as well as reducing some "
"of the brittleness of the code."
msgstr ""

